{"4894770":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Flow Treehouse","steam_appid":4894770,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5067650,5341420],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny treehouse lives in the corner of your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prince Tomato times your focus sessions, Todudu keeps an eye on your to-do list, and Lily plays you something soft. They don't take up much room and they won't nag. They just stay close while you work, study, or take a break.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focusing, finishing tasks, and playing with the fairies all earn wish points. Spend them on new outfits, playlists, and treehouse decorations. As your wish points add up, the treehouse grows, and that's how Todudu and Lily move in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/673039c65edeaf6364e7e2d51f971ece.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it's time to focus, ask Prince Tomato to keep time. While you work, he reads, paints, or knits beside you. When time's up he lets you know and drops a few little gifts. Sweep your mouse over them to turn them into wish points.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/df9c03b575b00acf5c6bc56afb59e1ec.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/df9c03b575b00acf5c6bc56afb59e1ec.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/df9c03b575b00acf5c6bc56afb59e1ec.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/7ca84d5a9270c8b7a3ed7a770df36c59.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write today's tasks on the to-do board and Todudu will keep watch. Each time you check one off, she hops over, pulls up a carrot and eats it. If a task sits for too long, she'll give you a gentle reminder.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/b4fcad77c02ede7f1c7c5180591f35c8.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/b4fcad77c02ede7f1c7c5180591f35c8.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/b4fcad77c02ede7f1c7c5180591f35c8.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/1ff80ffd1d84c6a431c88ec9b7865db4.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music in the treehouse belongs to Lily. Over a hundred gentle tracks are spread across more than a dozen albums, from music-box lullabies and Chopin nocturnes to lo-fi, vaporwave and medieval tavern tunes. Save your favorites, press play, and she sings along.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/3ad2238be0f89d4f76a5e9fd21363b36.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/3ad2238be0f89d4f76a5e9fd21363b36.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/3ad2238be0f89d4f76a5e9fd21363b36.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/26a61a4abf03364b68fbc4d201ff65fe.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish several pomodoros in a row, leave a task sitting too long, or let the music go quiet for a while, and the fairies will notice and pop up to say something. Sometimes Todudu hides in the grass and waits for you to find her.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/821c16fefb12214e0ae1ed936fbbae27.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/821c16fefb12214e0ae1ed936fbbae27.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/821c16fefb12214e0ae1ed936fbbae27.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/8b4add6c7cb2db9eabc7ed8ec24f0dd5.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put up the rainy-day gate and you'll find a watering can hanging on it. Drag it to water the fairies, or the ground to make flowers pop up. Keep poking the decorations and a tiny hat might fall off for a fairy to wear all day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5deb37f339434ae00672a0962217130b.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5deb37f339434ae00672a0962217130b.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5deb37f339434ae00672a0962217130b.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/f9881c2a6fd313a10ff1271f1176824a.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fairy has a short comic story of their own. It unlocks as the fairy levels up with you, or you can spend wish points to open it early.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5d662d9592dd1e67b547ca9b68c90b95.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5d662d9592dd1e67b547ca9b68c90b95.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5d662d9592dd1e67b547ca9b68c90b95.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/f1ae0eb821d2ec24d7f749acc50ac456.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've saved enough wish points, make a wish. Outfits, playlists, backgrounds, plants, and new looks for the timer and to-do board are all in the pool. There are no microtransactions; wish points come only from spending time together. More fairies will move into the treehouse later on.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/fa82f0357f03b049a61986a1445b7647.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/fa82f0357f03b049a61986a1445b7647.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/fa82f0357f03b049a61986a1445b7647.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/2123fd00e318694e18c03e58beeda0ae.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you collect, from backgrounds and plants to gates and trinkets, lives in your collection book, ready to put on display whenever you like.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/59147635ed2fb8873eb4d4f23f0d217b.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/59147635ed2fb8873eb4d4f23f0d217b.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/59147635ed2fb8873eb4d4f23f0d217b.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tiny treehouse lives in the corner of your desktop.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prince Tomato times your focus sessions, Todudu keeps an eye on your to-do list, and Lily plays you something soft. They don't take up much room and they won't nag. They just stay close while you work, study, or take a break.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focusing, finishing tasks, and playing with the fairies all earn wish points. Spend them on new outfits, playlists, and treehouse decorations. As your wish points add up, the treehouse grows, and that's how Todudu and Lily move in.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/673039c65edeaf6364e7e2d51f971ece.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When it's time to focus, ask Prince Tomato to keep time. While you work, he reads, paints, or knits beside you. When time's up he lets you know and drops a few little gifts. Sweep your mouse over them to turn them into wish points.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/df9c03b575b00acf5c6bc56afb59e1ec.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/df9c03b575b00acf5c6bc56afb59e1ec.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/df9c03b575b00acf5c6bc56afb59e1ec.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/7ca84d5a9270c8b7a3ed7a770df36c59.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Write today's tasks on the to-do board and Todudu will keep watch. Each time you check one off, she hops over, pulls up a carrot and eats it. If a task sits for too long, she'll give you a gentle reminder.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/b4fcad77c02ede7f1c7c5180591f35c8.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/b4fcad77c02ede7f1c7c5180591f35c8.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/b4fcad77c02ede7f1c7c5180591f35c8.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/1ff80ffd1d84c6a431c88ec9b7865db4.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music in the treehouse belongs to Lily. Over a hundred gentle tracks are spread across more than a dozen albums, from music-box lullabies and Chopin nocturnes to lo-fi, vaporwave and medieval tavern tunes. Save your favorites, press play, and she sings along.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/3ad2238be0f89d4f76a5e9fd21363b36.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/3ad2238be0f89d4f76a5e9fd21363b36.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/3ad2238be0f89d4f76a5e9fd21363b36.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/26a61a4abf03364b68fbc4d201ff65fe.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish several pomodoros in a row, leave a task sitting too long, or let the music go quiet for a while, and the fairies will notice and pop up to say something. Sometimes Todudu hides in the grass and waits for you to find her.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/821c16fefb12214e0ae1ed936fbbae27.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/821c16fefb12214e0ae1ed936fbbae27.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/821c16fefb12214e0ae1ed936fbbae27.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/8b4add6c7cb2db9eabc7ed8ec24f0dd5.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put up the rainy-day gate and you'll find a watering can hanging on it. Drag it to water the fairies, or the ground to make flowers pop up. Keep poking the decorations and a tiny hat might fall off for a fairy to wear all day.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5deb37f339434ae00672a0962217130b.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5deb37f339434ae00672a0962217130b.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5deb37f339434ae00672a0962217130b.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/f9881c2a6fd313a10ff1271f1176824a.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each fairy has a short comic story of their own. It unlocks as the fairy levels up with you, or you can spend wish points to open it early.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5d662d9592dd1e67b547ca9b68c90b95.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5d662d9592dd1e67b547ca9b68c90b95.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/5d662d9592dd1e67b547ca9b68c90b95.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/f1ae0eb821d2ec24d7f749acc50ac456.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've saved enough wish points, make a wish. Outfits, playlists, backgrounds, plants, and new looks for the timer and to-do board are all in the pool. There are no microtransactions; wish points come only from spending time together. More fairies will move into the treehouse later on.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/fa82f0357f03b049a61986a1445b7647.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/fa82f0357f03b049a61986a1445b7647.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/fa82f0357f03b049a61986a1445b7647.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/2123fd00e318694e18c03e58beeda0ae.avif?t=1792272892\" width=1355 height=168 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you collect, from backgrounds and plants to gates and trinkets, lives in your collection book, ready to put on display whenever you like.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/59147635ed2fb8873eb4d4f23f0d217b.poster.avif?t=1792272892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/59147635ed2fb8873eb4d4f23f0d217b.webm?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/extras\/59147635ed2fb8873eb4d4f23f0d217b.mp4?t=1792272892\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A tiny treehouse tucked into the corner of your desktop. Prince Tomato times your focus, Todudu keeps your to-dos, and Lily plays soft music. Focus, finish tasks and play with them to earn wish points for outfits, playlists and decorations. As the treehouse grows, new fairies move in.","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/cee222e2d1672c7851122de5232ab63111ce436b\/header.jpg?t=1792272892","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/0549529239aaf9c6c4723787b9dcb1efccffdee8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792272892","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/0549529239aaf9c6c4723787b9dcb1efccffdee8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792272892","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 520 or NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon RX 560<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 500 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 GPU or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1000 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 13 Ventura or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8192 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 GPU or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1000 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Fairy Tea Time"],"publishers":["Fairy Tea Time"],"demos":[{"appid":5341420,"description":""}],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/494e8c5568c7dd828f94dcb3e5db39e8276c0707\/ss_494e8c5568c7dd828f94dcb3e5db39e8276c0707.600x338.jpg?t=1792272892","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/494e8c5568c7dd828f94dcb3e5db39e8276c0707\/ss_494e8c5568c7dd828f94dcb3e5db39e8276c0707.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792272892"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4894770\/50b8970eeaf003c57bab8f46f48290c55e3b564